1
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:04,022
Water...

2
00:00:04,857 --> 00:00:06,108
Earth...

3
00:00:06,693 --> 00:00:07,985
Fire...

4
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:10,320
Air...

5
00:00:11,072 --> 00:00:14,533
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,285 --> 00:00:18,787
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,622 --> 00:00:22,457
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22,542 --> 00:00:23,667
could stop them.

9
00:00:23,751 --> 00:00:25,544
But when the world needed him most,

10
00:00:25,628 --> 00:00:26,795
he vanished.

11
00:00:27,255 --> 00:00:29,256
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I

12
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:32,634
discovered the new Avatar,
an airbender named Aang.

13
00:00:32,969 --> 00:00:35,095
And although his airbending
skills were great,

14
00:00:35,179 --> 00:00:38,598
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

15
00:00:38,975 --> 00:00:42,102
But I believe Aang can save the world.

16
00:01:01,539 --> 00:01:03,999
Let's go, Appa! Come on, boy.

17
00:01:06,085 --> 00:01:08,211
Look, I'm sorry, but Katara and Sokka

18
00:01:08,296 --> 00:01:10,088
aren't coming
to the Fire Nation with us.

19
00:01:10,715 --> 00:01:13,258
If they got hurt,
I'd never forgive myself.

20
00:01:13,968 --> 00:01:16,303
So get your big butt
off the ground and let's go!

21
00:01:17,555 --> 00:01:18,889
Aah!

22
00:01:19,223 --> 00:01:20,223
I think his big butt

23
00:01:20,308 --> 00:01:21,391
is trying to tell you something.

24
00:01:21,768 --> 00:01:23,268
Please don't go, Aang.

25
00:01:23,353 --> 00:01:25,896
The world can't afford to lose you
to the Fire Nation.

26
00:01:26,397 --> 00:01:27,481
Neither can I.

27
00:01:32,820 --> 00:01:34,571
But I have to talk to Avatar Roku

28
00:01:34,655 --> 00:01:36,031
to find out what my vision means.

29
00:01:36,366 --> 00:01:38,158
I need to get to the fire temple

30
00:01:38,242 --> 00:01:39,868
before the sun sets on the solstice.

31
00:01:40,203 --> 00:01:41,328
That's today!

32
00:01:44,665 --> 00:01:47,542
We're not letting you
go into the Fire Nation, Aang.

33
00:01:48,419 --> 00:01:50,295
At least not without your friends.

34
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:51,546
We got your back.

35
00:01:54,717 --> 00:01:55,759
Ew!

36
00:01:55,843 --> 00:01:58,220
It's a long journey
to the crescent island.

37
00:01:58,638 --> 00:02:00,389
You'll have to fly fast
to have any chance

38
00:02:00,473 --> 00:02:02,265
of making it before sundown.

39
00:02:02,892 --> 00:02:03,892
Good luck.

40
00:02:03,976 --> 00:02:04,976
Thank you for your--

41
00:02:05,061 --> 00:02:06,061
Go!

42
00:02:12,693 --> 00:02:13,902
Having trouble sleeping?

43
00:02:16,572 --> 00:02:18,240
Seen the Avatar lately?

44
00:02:27,250 --> 00:02:29,459
Come on, boy.
We've got a long way to go.

45
00:02:29,544 --> 00:02:30,544
Faster!

46
00:02:36,384 --> 00:02:38,927
Sailing into Fire Nation waters.

47
00:02:39,846 --> 00:02:41,805
Of all the foolish things you've done

48
00:02:41,889 --> 00:02:44,599
in your 16 years, Prince Zuko,

49
00:02:44,684 --> 00:02:47,310
this is the most foolish.

50
00:02:47,395 --> 00:02:48,854
I have no choice, uncle.

51
00:02:49,397 --> 00:02:51,022
Have you completely forgotten

52
00:02:51,107 --> 00:02:53,567
that the Fire Lord banished you?

53
00:02:54,068 --> 00:02:55,277
What if you're caught?

54
00:02:55,570 --> 00:02:57,279
I'm chasing the Avatar.

55
00:02:57,363 --> 00:02:59,239
My father will understand
why I'm returning home.

56
00:02:59,615 --> 00:03:01,825
You give him too much credit.

57
00:03:01,909 --> 00:03:04,536
My brother is not
the understanding type.

58
00:03:08,249 --> 00:03:09,624
There they are.

59
00:03:09,834 --> 00:03:11,543
Helmsman, full steam ahead.

60
00:03:13,546 --> 00:03:15,213
Aang, we got trouble.

61
00:03:15,298 --> 00:03:17,174
Yeah, and it's gaining fast!

62
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:27,976
Really, Prince Zuko,
couldn't you shoot them down

63
00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:29,561
with something more fragrant?

64
00:03:32,857 --> 00:03:34,316
On my mark.

65
00:03:34,609 --> 00:03:35,609
Fire!

66
00:03:38,404 --> 00:03:39,863
Fire ball!

67
00:03:39,947 --> 00:03:40,947
I'm on it!

68
00:03:44,952 --> 00:03:46,786
We have to get out of Zuko's range

69
00:03:46,871 --> 00:03:49,122
before he shoots
another hotsticker at us!

70
00:03:49,332 --> 00:03:51,124
Can't you make Appa go any faster?

71
00:03:51,584 --> 00:03:53,919
Yeah, but there's
just one little problem.

72
00:03:54,545 --> 00:03:55,670
A blockade.

73
00:04:02,637 --> 00:04:03,970
Technically, you are still

74
00:04:04,055 --> 00:04:05,514
in Earth Kingdom waters.

75
00:04:05,598 --> 00:04:07,766
Turn back now,
and they cannot arrest you.

76
00:04:08,226 --> 00:04:09,226
If we fly north,

77
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:10,810
we can go around the Fire Nation ships

78
00:04:10,895 --> 00:04:12,229
and avoid the blockade.

79
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:13,688
It's the only way.

80
00:04:13,773 --> 00:04:15,398
There's no time!

81
00:04:15,483 --> 00:04:17,359
This is exactly why
I didn't want you to come.

82
00:04:17,443 --> 00:04:18,944
It's too dangerous.

83
00:04:19,028 --> 00:04:20,779
And that's exactly why we're here.

84
00:04:20,863 --> 00:04:22,614
Let's run this blockade.

85
00:04:23,407 --> 00:04:24,574
Appa, yip yip!

86
00:04:27,411 --> 00:04:28,703
He's not turning around.

87
00:04:28,788 --> 00:04:32,374
Please, Prince Zuko.
If the Fire Nation captures you,

88
00:04:32,458 --> 00:04:34,376
There is nothing I can do.

89
00:04:34,460 --> 00:04:36,545
Do not follow the Avatar.

90
00:04:37,171 --> 00:04:38,421
I'm sorry, uncle.

91
00:04:39,257 --> 00:04:40,840
Run the blockade!

92
00:04:41,676 --> 00:04:43,426
The Avatar...

93
00:04:44,136 --> 00:04:46,346
And the banished prince.

94
00:04:46,931 --> 00:04:49,474
This must be my lucky day.

95
00:04:49,559 --> 00:04:51,851
Commander Zhao, what are your orders?

96
00:04:51,936 --> 00:04:54,062
Shoot the bison down, captain.

97
00:04:54,146 --> 00:04:57,107
But there's a fire navy ship
out there, sir-- One of our own.

98
00:04:57,191 --> 00:04:58,233
What if it's hit?

99
00:04:58,317 --> 00:05:00,860
So be it. It belongs to a traitor.

100
00:05:01,404 --> 00:05:02,404
Ignite!

101
00:05:05,908 --> 00:05:06,908
Launch!

102
00:05:10,955 --> 00:05:12,289
Aah! Aah! Aah!

103
00:05:29,223 --> 00:05:30,557
Appa, are you ok?

104
00:05:44,989 --> 00:05:47,240
Prince Zuko, the engines are damaged!

105
00:05:47,325 --> 00:05:49,534
We need to stop and make repairs!

106
00:05:49,869 --> 00:05:51,661
Do not stop this ship.

107
00:05:52,204 --> 00:05:53,204
Launch!

108
00:05:58,711 --> 00:06:01,004
Aah!

109
00:06:08,679 --> 00:06:11,056
Aah! Aah! Aah!

110
00:06:12,183 --> 00:06:13,350
Aah!

111
00:06:14,310 --> 00:06:16,478
Sokka!

112
00:06:18,689 --> 00:06:23,360
Aah!

113
00:06:38,167 --> 00:06:39,334
Ready.

114
00:06:44,131 --> 00:06:45,131
Fire!

115
00:06:48,177 --> 00:06:49,803
Aah!

116
00:06:58,479 --> 00:07:00,563
Aah! Ooh!

117
00:07:06,946 --> 00:07:08,029
We made it!

118
00:07:08,114 --> 00:07:10,907
We got into the Fire Nation. Great.

119
00:07:11,492 --> 00:07:13,535
Where do you think
the Avatar is headed, sir?

120
00:07:13,619 --> 00:07:15,537
I'm not sure,

121
00:07:15,621 --> 00:07:18,248
but I bet a certain
banished prince will know.

122
00:07:21,127 --> 00:07:22,627
We're on a collision course!

123
00:07:22,712 --> 00:07:23,878
We can make it.

124
00:07:24,380 --> 00:07:27,257
The boarding party is ready
to apprehend Prince Zuko, sir.

125
00:07:27,633 --> 00:07:29,551
Wait. Cut the engines

126
00:07:29,635 --> 00:07:30,844
and let them pass.

127
00:07:30,928 --> 00:07:31,928
Sir?

128
00:07:53,951 --> 00:07:54,951
There it is--

129
00:07:55,661 --> 00:07:57,704
The island
where Roku's dragon took me.

130
00:08:03,210 --> 00:08:05,336
You did it, buddy. Nice flying.

131
00:08:06,881 --> 00:08:08,923
You must be tired.

132
00:08:09,008 --> 00:08:14,804
No, I'm good. Refreshed and ready
to fight some firebenders.

133
00:08:14,889 --> 00:08:16,765
I was talking to Appa.

134
00:08:17,349 --> 00:08:19,559
Well, I was talking to Momo.

135
00:08:27,526 --> 00:08:28,985
I don't see any guards.

136
00:08:29,069 --> 00:08:30,069
The Fire Nation

137
00:08:30,154 --> 00:08:31,196
must have abandoned the temple

138
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:32,614
when Avatar Roku died.

139
00:08:32,907 --> 00:08:34,949
It's almost sundown.
We'd better hurry.

140
00:08:44,877 --> 00:08:47,670
Wait. I think I heard something.

141
00:08:48,714 --> 00:08:54,719
We are the fire sages,
guardians of the temple of the Avatar.

142
00:08:55,179 --> 00:08:56,888
Great. I am the Avatar.

143
00:08:57,473 --> 00:08:58,473
We know.

144
00:09:04,563 --> 00:09:06,064
I'll hold them off. Run!

145
00:09:10,903 --> 00:09:13,404
If the Avatar contacts Roku,

146
00:09:13,489 --> 00:09:15,865
there's no telling how powerful
the boy will become.

147
00:09:15,950 --> 00:09:17,700
Split up and find him.

148
00:09:21,622 --> 00:09:22,622
Follow me!

149
00:09:22,706 --> 00:09:23,748
Do you know where you're going?

150
00:09:24,041 --> 00:09:25,041
Nope.

151
00:09:26,752 --> 00:09:28,211
Wrong way!

152
00:09:28,838 --> 00:09:29,921
Come back!

153
00:09:35,845 --> 00:09:38,763
I don't want to fight you.
I am a friend.

154
00:09:39,265 --> 00:09:41,057
Firebenders aren't our friends.

155
00:09:43,894 --> 00:09:46,062
I know why you're here, Avatar.

156
00:09:46,146 --> 00:09:47,272
You do?

157
00:09:47,356 --> 00:09:50,650
Yes. You wish to speak to Avatar Roku.

158
00:09:51,318 --> 00:09:52,861
I can take you to him.

159
00:09:52,945 --> 00:09:53,945
How?

160
00:09:59,660 --> 00:10:00,660
This way.

161
00:10:01,453 --> 00:10:02,453
Find him!

162
00:10:03,873 --> 00:10:05,456
Time is running out! Quickly!

163
00:10:14,425 --> 00:10:16,092
What's he up to, uncle?

164
00:10:16,176 --> 00:10:18,219
Why didn't Commander Zhao arrest me?

165
00:10:18,304 --> 00:10:20,680
Because he wants to follow you.

166
00:10:20,764 --> 00:10:22,098
He knows you'll lead him

167
00:10:22,182 --> 00:10:24,392
to the prize you're both after--

168
00:10:24,476 --> 00:10:25,602
The Avatar.

169
00:10:26,312 --> 00:10:28,313
If Zhao wants to follow
our trail of smoke,

170
00:10:28,397 --> 00:10:30,607
then that's exactly
what I'll let him do.

171
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:34,027
Avatar Roku once called
this temple his home.

172
00:10:34,528 --> 00:10:37,614
He formed these secret passages
out of the magma.

173
00:10:37,698 --> 00:10:39,490
Did you know Avatar Roku?

174
00:10:39,575 --> 00:10:42,201
No, but my grandfather knew him.

175
00:10:42,828 --> 00:10:44,662
Many generations of fire sages

176
00:10:44,747 --> 00:10:47,332
guarded this temple long before me.

177
00:10:47,416 --> 00:10:49,542
We all have a strong
spiritual connection

178
00:10:49,627 --> 00:10:51,044
to this place.

179
00:10:51,128 --> 00:10:52,587
Is that how you knew I was coming?

180
00:10:52,963 --> 00:10:56,049
A few weeks ago,
an amazing thing occurred.

181
00:10:56,133 --> 00:10:58,259
The statue of Avatar Roku--

182
00:10:58,886 --> 00:11:00,678
Its eyes began to glow.

183
00:11:00,763 --> 00:11:02,680
That's when we were
at the air temple.

184
00:11:02,765 --> 00:11:05,391
Avatar Roku's eyes
were glowing there, too.

185
00:11:05,476 --> 00:11:09,145
At that moment,
we knew you had returned to the world.

186
00:11:09,688 --> 00:11:11,648
If this is the Avatar's temple,

187
00:11:11,732 --> 00:11:13,399
why did the sages attack me?

188
00:11:13,484 --> 00:11:15,234
Things have changed.

189
00:11:15,319 --> 00:11:16,945
In the past, the sages were loyal

190
00:11:17,029 --> 00:11:18,655
only to the Avatar.

191
00:11:19,198 --> 00:11:23,952
When Roku died, the sages eagerly
awaited for the next Avatar to return,

192
00:11:24,370 --> 00:11:25,828
but he never came.

193
00:11:26,246 --> 00:11:27,789
They were waiting for me.

194
00:11:27,873 --> 00:11:30,583
Hey, don't feel bad.
You're only 100 years late.

195
00:11:31,001 --> 00:11:33,544
They lost hope that the Avatar
would ever return.

196
00:11:33,963 --> 00:11:36,631
When Fire Lord Sozin began the war,

197
00:11:36,715 --> 00:11:38,633
my grandfather and the other sages

198
00:11:38,717 --> 00:11:40,885
were forced to follow him.

199
00:11:40,970 --> 00:11:43,680
I never wanted to serve the Fire Lord.

200
00:11:44,306 --> 00:11:46,057
When I learned you were coming,

201
00:11:46,141 --> 00:11:48,559
I knew I would have to
betray the other sages.

202
00:11:48,978 --> 00:11:50,186
Thank you for helping me.

203
00:11:52,648 --> 00:11:54,482
We'll follow these stairs
to the sanctuary.

204
00:11:55,401 --> 00:11:56,901
Once you're inside,

205
00:11:56,986 --> 00:11:59,904
wait for the light to hit
Avatar Roku's statue.

206
00:12:00,239 --> 00:12:02,699
Only then will you be
able to speak with him.

207
00:12:11,792 --> 00:12:12,792
No!

208
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:15,169
Shyu, what's wrong?

209
00:12:15,462 --> 00:12:18,381
The sanctuary doors-- They're closed.

210
00:12:18,465 --> 00:12:20,675
Can't you just open them
with firebending,

211
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:22,218
like you opened that other door?

212
00:12:22,636 --> 00:12:26,055
No. Only a fully realized Avatar

213
00:12:26,140 --> 00:12:28,516
is powerful enough
to open this door alone.

214
00:12:29,018 --> 00:12:31,936
Otherwise, the sages must
open the doors together

215
00:12:32,271 --> 00:12:35,314
with five simultaneous fire blasts.

216
00:12:35,733 --> 00:12:37,400
Five fire blasts?

217
00:12:38,777 --> 00:12:40,236
I think I can help you out.

218
00:12:42,906 --> 00:12:44,449
Uncle, keep heading north.

219
00:12:44,825 --> 00:12:46,325
Zhao will follow the smoke trail

220
00:12:46,410 --> 00:12:47,994
while I use it as a cover.

221
00:12:57,838 --> 00:12:58,838
This is a little trick

222
00:12:58,922 --> 00:13:00,256
I picked up from my father.

223
00:13:00,591 --> 00:13:03,634
I seal the lamp oil inside
an animal skin casing.

224
00:13:04,053 --> 00:13:05,928
Shyu lights the oil-soaked twine,

225
00:13:06,013 --> 00:13:07,096
and ta da!

226
00:13:07,181 --> 00:13:08,556
Fake firebending.

227
00:13:09,058 --> 00:13:11,184
You're really outdone yourself
this time, Sokka.

228
00:13:11,268 --> 00:13:13,269
This might actually work.

229
00:13:16,148 --> 00:13:17,690
The sages will hear the explosion,

230
00:13:17,775 --> 00:13:19,776
so as soon as they go off,
you rush in.

231
00:13:22,529 --> 00:13:24,530
It's almost sunset. Are you ready?

232
00:13:24,615 --> 00:13:25,698
Definitely.

233
00:13:34,249 --> 00:13:35,249
Ooh!

234
00:13:41,673 --> 00:13:42,715
They're still locked!

235
00:13:46,512 --> 00:13:48,179
It didn't work.

236
00:13:58,232 --> 00:14:02,193
Why won't it open?!!

237
00:14:02,945 --> 00:14:04,654
Aang, stop.

238
00:14:04,988 --> 00:14:06,489
There's nothing else we can do.

239
00:14:06,573 --> 00:14:09,534
I'm sorry I put you
through all this for nothing.

240
00:14:09,618 --> 00:14:10,701
I don't get it.

241
00:14:11,286 --> 00:14:12,662
That blast looked as strong

242
00:14:12,746 --> 00:14:14,288
as any firebending I've seen.

243
00:14:15,207 --> 00:14:17,625
Sokka, you're a genius!

244
00:14:17,709 --> 00:14:19,627
Wait. How is Sokka a genius?

245
00:14:19,711 --> 00:14:21,045
His plan didn't even work.

246
00:14:21,547 --> 00:14:23,589
Come on, Aang. Let her dream.

247
00:14:24,133 --> 00:14:27,218
You're right.
Sokka's plan didn't work,

248
00:14:27,302 --> 00:14:29,387
but it looks like it did.

249
00:14:29,638 --> 00:14:31,222
Did the definition of genius change

250
00:14:31,306 --> 00:14:32,932
in the last 100 years?

251
00:14:33,851 --> 00:14:36,644
Come quickly!
The Avatar has entered the sanctuary!

252
00:14:36,728 --> 00:14:38,020
How did he get in?

253
00:14:38,105 --> 00:14:40,606
I know, but look at the scorch marks,

254
00:14:40,691 --> 00:14:41,691
and down there.

255
00:14:43,777 --> 00:14:47,029
He's inside.
Open the doors immediately

256
00:14:47,406 --> 00:14:50,449
before he contacts Avatar Roku.

257
00:15:04,882 --> 00:15:06,424
It's the Avatar's lemur.

258
00:15:06,717 --> 00:15:08,843
He must have crawled
through the pipes.

259
00:15:08,927 --> 00:15:10,136
We've been tricked!

260
00:15:10,220 --> 00:15:11,304
Aah!

261
00:15:14,558 --> 00:15:15,558
Now, Aang.

262
00:15:17,352 --> 00:15:18,853
Aang, now's your chance!

263
00:15:21,231 --> 00:15:23,232
The Avatar's coming with me.

264
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:29,655
Close the doors, quickly!

265
00:15:35,204 --> 00:15:36,787
Aah!

266
00:15:37,497 --> 00:15:38,497
Go!

267
00:15:45,881 --> 00:15:46,881
He made it!

268
00:15:59,770 --> 00:16:02,271
The light hits the statue,
and I talk to Roku.

269
00:16:02,356 --> 00:16:03,856
So why isn't anything happening?

270
00:16:09,488 --> 00:16:11,781
Why isn't it working?
It's sealed shut.

271
00:16:11,865 --> 00:16:13,616
It must have been the light.

272
00:16:13,700 --> 00:16:16,285
Avatar Roku doesn't want us inside.

273
00:16:19,039 --> 00:16:20,873
Why isn't anything happening?

274
00:16:21,583 --> 00:16:23,000
I don't know what I'm doing.

275
00:16:23,085 --> 00:16:24,543
All I know is airbending.

276
00:16:24,628 --> 00:16:26,629
Please, Avatar Roku, talk to me.

277
00:16:34,513 --> 00:16:36,555
It's good to see you, Aang.

278
00:16:37,224 --> 00:16:39,141
What took you so long?

279
00:16:43,855 --> 00:16:45,606
Why did you help the Avatar?

280
00:16:45,691 --> 00:16:48,401
Because it was once the sage's duty.

281
00:16:48,902 --> 00:16:51,445
It is still our duty.

282
00:16:55,242 --> 00:16:58,536
What a moving
and heartfelt performance.

283
00:16:59,371 --> 00:17:01,789
I'm certain the Fire Lord
will understand

284
00:17:01,873 --> 00:17:04,625
when you explain why you betrayed him.

285
00:17:04,710 --> 00:17:05,960
Commander Zhao--

286
00:17:06,545 --> 00:17:08,045
And, Prince Zuko,

287
00:17:08,130 --> 00:17:10,256
it was a noble effort,

288
00:17:10,340 --> 00:17:13,342
but your little smokescreen
didn't work.

289
00:17:13,677 --> 00:17:16,220
Two traitors in one day.

290
00:17:16,305 --> 00:17:18,347
The Fire Lord will be pleased.

291
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:20,141
You're too late, Zhao.

292
00:17:20,225 --> 00:17:21,600
The Avatar's inside,

293
00:17:21,685 --> 00:17:22,685
and the doors are sealed.

294
00:17:23,061 --> 00:17:25,771
No matter. Sooner or later,

295
00:17:25,856 --> 00:17:27,481
he has to come out.

296
00:17:31,445 --> 00:17:35,281
I have something very important
to tell you, Aang.

297
00:17:35,615 --> 00:17:39,869
That is why,
when you were in the spirit world,

298
00:17:39,953 --> 00:17:42,204
I sent my dragon to find you.

299
00:17:42,581 --> 00:17:44,040
Is it about that vision--

300
00:17:44,124 --> 00:17:45,124
The one of the comet?

301
00:17:45,375 --> 00:17:46,459
Yes.

302
00:17:46,543 --> 00:17:47,668
What does it mean?

303
00:17:47,961 --> 00:17:50,046
100 years ago,

304
00:17:50,130 --> 00:17:52,423
Fire Lord Sozin used that comet

305
00:17:52,507 --> 00:17:54,175
to begin the war.

306
00:17:54,259 --> 00:17:56,719
He and his firebending army

307
00:17:56,803 --> 00:17:59,055
harnessed its incredible power

308
00:17:59,139 --> 00:18:01,057
and dealt a deadly first strike

309
00:18:01,141 --> 00:18:03,142
against the other nations.

310
00:18:03,226 --> 00:18:05,269
So the comet made them stronger?

311
00:18:05,687 --> 00:18:09,398
Yes, stronger than you
could even imagine.

312
00:18:09,608 --> 00:18:11,442
But that happened a hundred years ago.

313
00:18:11,526 --> 00:18:13,736
What does the comet
have to do with the war now?

314
00:18:13,820 --> 00:18:15,154
Listen carefully.

315
00:18:15,906 --> 00:18:19,200
Sozin's Comet will return
by the end of this summer,

316
00:18:19,284 --> 00:18:21,869
and Fire Lord Ozai will use its power

317
00:18:21,953 --> 00:18:24,789
to finish the war once and for all.

318
00:18:24,873 --> 00:18:26,582
Aah!

319
00:18:27,334 --> 00:18:29,919
If he succeeds, even the Avatar

320
00:18:30,003 --> 00:18:32,922
won't be able to restore
balance to the world.

321
00:18:33,006 --> 00:18:36,550
Aang, you must defeat the Fire Lord

322
00:18:36,635 --> 00:18:38,594
before the comet arrives.

323
00:18:39,054 --> 00:18:41,055
But I haven't even started
learning waterbending,

324
00:18:41,139 --> 00:18:43,057
not to mention earth and fire.

325
00:18:43,141 --> 00:18:47,269
Mastering the elements takes years
of discipline and practice,

326
00:18:47,604 --> 00:18:49,814
But if the world is to survive,

327
00:18:49,898 --> 00:18:52,608
you must do it by summer's end.

328
00:19:00,575 --> 00:19:02,410
When those doors open,

329
00:19:02,494 --> 00:19:04,829
unleash all your firepower.

330
00:19:05,247 --> 00:19:07,081
How's Aang gonna make it out of this?

331
00:19:07,165 --> 00:19:08,499
How are we gonna make it out of this?

332
00:19:11,711 --> 00:19:13,921
What if I can't master
all the elements in time?

333
00:19:14,005 --> 00:19:15,172
What if I fail?

334
00:19:15,257 --> 00:19:17,299
I know you can do it, Aang,

335
00:19:17,717 --> 00:19:20,719
for you have done it before.

336
00:19:21,096 --> 00:19:23,347
The solstice is ending.

337
00:19:23,432 --> 00:19:27,852
We must go our separate ways for now.

338
00:19:27,936 --> 00:19:29,979
But I won't be able
to come back to the temple.

339
00:19:30,355 --> 00:19:31,856
What if I have questions?

340
00:19:31,940 --> 00:19:33,065
How will I talk to you?

341
00:19:33,442 --> 00:19:35,943
I am a part of you.

342
00:19:36,027 --> 00:19:38,904
When you need to talk to me again,

343
00:19:38,989 --> 00:19:41,198
you will find a way.

344
00:19:43,201 --> 00:19:46,412
A great danger awaits you
at the temple.

345
00:19:47,289 --> 00:19:49,707
I can help you face the threat,

346
00:19:49,791 --> 00:19:51,417
But only if you are ready.

347
00:19:53,670 --> 00:19:54,670
I'm ready.

348
00:20:05,348 --> 00:20:06,640
Ready...

349
00:20:07,976 --> 00:20:09,393
No! Aang!

350
00:20:09,936 --> 00:20:10,936
Fire!

351
00:20:17,652 --> 00:20:18,944
Avatar Roku!

352
00:20:31,541 --> 00:20:33,459
Avatar Roku is going to
destroy the temple.

353
00:20:33,543 --> 00:20:34,919
We have to get out of here!

354
00:20:35,003 --> 00:20:36,253
Not without Aang!

355
00:21:07,035 --> 00:21:08,285
We got your back.

356
00:21:08,703 --> 00:21:10,538
Thanks. Where's Shyu?

357
00:21:10,622 --> 00:21:11,622
I don't know.

358
00:21:37,482 --> 00:21:40,234
No prince, no Avatar.

359
00:21:40,360 --> 00:21:42,444
Apparently the only thing I do have

360
00:21:42,696 --> 00:21:44,280
is five traitors.

361
00:21:44,364 --> 00:21:47,032
But, Commander,
only Shyu helped the Avatar.

362
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,410
Save your stories for the Fire Lord.

363
00:21:49,703 --> 00:21:51,412
As far as I'm concerned,

364
00:21:51,496 --> 00:21:53,372
you are all guilty.

365
00:21:53,665 --> 00:21:55,124
Take them to the prison hold!
